    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_dx_items",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 485,
      "text": "• Trace UI: 呼叫堆疊、工具互動、記憶流可視化\n• Playground: 互動式 prompt 精煉與 A/B 測試\n• Eval UI: Regression test、benchmark 評估\n• Centralized Agent Management: 設定版本控制",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#2e2e2e",
      "originalText": "• Trace UI: 呼叫堆疊、工具互動、記憶流可視化\n• Playground: 互動式 prompt 精煉與 A/B 測試\n• Eval UI: Regression test、benchmark 評估\n• Centralized Agent Management: 設定版本控制",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_insight",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 680,
      "text": "⚠️ 常見錯誤：三者混用 → context bloat、spurious anchors、brittle debugging\n✅ CCA 作法：三條 channel 分離，各自優化，互不干擾",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "originalText": "⚠️ 常見錯誤：三者混用 → context bloat、spurious anchors、brittle debugging\n✅ CCA 作法：三條 channel 分離，各自優化，互不干擾",
      "autoResize": true
    },
